0..76 Comment "// Transport in a family over a point and a path to it from a fixed one, the"
77..154 Comment "// motive of based path induction (the HoTT book\'s § 1.12.1): at reflexivity"
155..225 Comment "// it computes to the element given, along the unit type\'s evidence it"
226..300 Comment "// computes into the unit fibre, it reverses a path when the family is the"
301..376 Comment "// paths back, and it refuses a family not over the path\'s own endpoints or"
377..403 Comment "// one that reads no path."
404..406 Comment "//"
407..440 Comment "// - see: #1854 — `carriedUnit`"
441..471 Comment "// - see: #1886 — `backUnit`"
473..494 Comment "// The free naturals."
